{"step_index":303,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:46:56Z","thinking":"**Examining Inequality & Set Properties**\n\nThe goal involves bounding a sum using a specific inequality concerning Finsets. The provided inequality has the form `sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg`, with an associated condition on non-negativity and subset inclusion. The error in `scratch_test.lean`'s line 8 likely stems from attempting to use this inequality to compare sums with the goal expression.\nThe goal, which is a cardinality sum, may need a suitable mapping function for the subset's elements to bound it as required by `sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg`. It's essential to ensure the subset condition and non-negativity constraint are met correctly in the problematic line.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\n\\nlemma sum_le_romanWeight {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] (f : V → Fin 3) :\\n    (Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 1)).card +\\n    2 * (Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 2)).card ≤ GraphCalc.romanWeight f := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanWeight\\n  let V1 := Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 1)\\n  let V2 := Finset.univ.filter (fun v => f v = 2)\\n  have hdisj : Disjoint V1 V2 := by\\n    rw [Finset.disjoint_filter]\\n    intro x _ h1 h2\\n    have h12 : (1 : Fin 3) = (2 : Fin 3) := h1.symm.trans h2\\n    revert h12\\n    decide\\n  have h1 : ∑ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) = V1.card := by\\n    have : ∀ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) = 1 := by\\n      intro v hv\\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hv\\n      rw [hv.2]\\n      rfl\\n    calc\\n      ∑ v ∈ V1, (f v : ℕ) = ∑ v ∈ V1, 1 := Finset.sum_congr rfl this\\n      _ = V1.card := by simp\\n  have h2 : ∑ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ) = 2 * V2.card := by\\n    have : ∀ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ) = 2 := by\\n      intro v hv\\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hv\\n      rw [hv.2]\\n      rfl\\n    calc\\n      ∑ v ∈ V2, (f v : ℕ) = ∑ v ∈ V2, 2 := Finset.sum_congr rfl this\\n      _ = 2 * V2.card := by simp [mul_comm]\\n  have hsub : V1 ∪ V2 ⊆ Finset.univ := Finset.subset_univ _\\n  have h_le : ∑ v ∈ V1 ∪ V2, (f v : ℕ) ≤ ∑ v ∈ (Finset.univ : Finset V), (f v : ℕ) :=\\n    Finset.sum_le_sum_of_subset_of_nonneg hsub (fun _ _ _ => Nat.zero_le _)\\n  rw [Finset.sum_union hdisj, h1, h2] at h_le\\n  exact h_le\\n\"","Description":"\"Testing sum_le_romanWeight in scratch_test.lean\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333/scratch_test.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Writing updated sum_le_romanWeight in scratch_test.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Write sum_le_romanWeight\""}}]}
