{"step_index":310,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:47:14Z","thinking":"**Verifying Dominating Function Bound**\n\nConsidered how previously verified elements, specifically the existence of a minimal Roman dominating function, relate to bounding the sum of the sizes of the sets $V_1$ and $V_2$ with the Roman domination number. The inequality `sum_le_romanWeight` ($|V_1| + 2|V_2|$) has been completely and successfully elaborated, ensuring the sum is less than or equal to the Roman domination number.\n\n\n**Constructing a Total Dominating Set**\n\nEstablished the definition of sets `V1`, `V2`, and `X` based on function `f` and the graph's adjacency. Proved that `X` is a subset of the union of `V1` and `V2`. This result is crucial for bounding the cardinality of the constructed set.\n\nDefined the total dominating set `S` as the union of `V2` and the image of `X` under a function `nbr`, derived from the property of total domination. This construction aims to satisfy the total domination condition and the size bound. Now, investigating the cardinality of `S`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph\\n\\nlemma minCard_le {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V] {p : Finset V → Prop} [DecidablePred p] {s : Finset V} (hs : p s) :\\n    GraphCalc.minCard p ≤ s.card := by\\n  unfold GraphCalc.minCard\\n  have hm : s.card ∈ (Finset.univ.powerset.filter p).image Finset.card := by\\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\\n    refine ⟨s, ?_, rfl⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_powerset.mpr (Finset.subset_univ s), hs⟩\\n  obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := Finset.min_of_mem hm\\n  have hle : a ≤ s.card := Finset.min_le_of_eq hm ha\\n  have hget : ((Finset.univ.powerset.filter p).image Finset.card).min.getD 0 = a := by\\n    rw [ha]\\n    rfl\\n  rw [hget]\\n  exact hle\\n\\nlemma exists_min_roman_dominating_function {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] :\\n    ∃ f : V → Fin 3, GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f ∧\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight f = GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber G := by\\n  let f_two : V → Fin 3 := fun _ => ⟨2, by decide⟩\\n  have hf_two : GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G f_two := by\\n    intro v hv\\n    change (⟨2, by decide⟩ : Fin 3) = 0 at hv\\n    have hne : (⟨2, by decide⟩ : Fin 3) ≠ 0 := by decide\\n    exact False.elim (hne hv)\\n  have h_nonempty : ((Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight).Nonempty := by\\n    refine ⟨GraphCalc.romanWeight f_two, ?_⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_image]\\n    refine ⟨f_two, ?_, rfl⟩\\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ _, hf_two⟩\\n  obtain ⟨m, hm⟩ := Finset.min_of_nonempty h_nonempty\\n  have hmem : m ∈ (Finset.univ.filter (GraphCalc.IsRomanDominatingFunction G)).image\\n      GraphCalc.romanWeight := Finset.mem_of_min hm\\n  rw [Finset.mem_image] at hmem\\n  obtain ⟨f, hf_filt, hfw⟩ := hmem\\n  rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hf_filt\\n  refine ⟨f, hf_filt.2, ?_⟩\\n  unfold GraphCalc.romanDominationNumber\\n  have hget : (((Finset.univ.fi\n<truncated 4838 bytes>","Description":"\"Testing complete proof of totalDom_le_romanDom in scratch_test.lean\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_40a99333/scratch_test.lean\"","toolAction":"\"Writing complete proof in scratch_test.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Write complete proof scratch\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
